群體、代詞與未定個人保留，不補名字或以祖系闕代推父子。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"戎、翟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、代詞與未定個人保留，不補名字或以祖系闕代推父子。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0082","start":82,"end":84,"surface":"悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAADAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"魏絳","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"諸侯","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、代詞與未定個人保留，不補名字或以祖系闕代推父子。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0108","start":108,"end":111,"surface":"戎、翟","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"氏族、群體、代詞與未定個人保留，不補名字或以祖系闕代推父子。"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"魏絳","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"昭子","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0146","start":146,"end":148,"surface":"魏嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0149","start":149,"end":150,"surface":"嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-044-wei:m006-0151","start":151,"end":154,"surface":"魏獻子","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-044-wei","book_id":"b-shiji-044","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-044-wei"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p004","text":"自是之後百有餘年，晉悼公使魏絳和戎翟，戎翟朝晉。後百有餘年，趙襄子踰句注而破并代以臨胡貉。其後既與韓魏共滅智伯，分晉地而有之，則趙有代、句注之北，魏有河西、上郡，以與戎界邊。其後義渠之戎築城郭以自守，而秦稍蠶食，至於惠王，遂拔義渠二十五城。惠王擊魏，魏盡入西河及上郡于秦。秦昭王時，義渠戎王與宣太后亂，有二子。宣太后詐而殺義渠戎王於甘泉，遂起兵伐殘義渠。於是秦有隴西、北地、上郡，築長城以拒胡。而趙武靈王亦變俗胡服，習騎射，北破林胡、樓煩。築長城，自代并陰山下，至高闕爲塞。而置雲中、鴈門、代郡。其後燕有賢將秦開，爲質於胡，胡甚信之。歸而襲破走東胡，東胡卻千餘里。與荊軻刺秦王秦舞陽者，開之孫也。燕亦築長城，自造陽至襄平。置上谷、漁陽、右北平、遼西、遼東郡以拒胡。當是之時，冠帶戰國七，而三國邊於匈奴。其後趙將李牧時，匈奴不敢入趙邊。後秦滅六國，而始皇帝使蒙恬將十萬之眾北擊胡，悉收河南地。因河爲塞，築四十四縣城臨河，徙適戍以充之。而通直道，自九原至雲陽，因邊山險塹谿谷可繕者治之，起臨洮至遼東萬餘里。又度河據陽山北假中。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0009","start":9,"end":12,"surface":"晉悼公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAADAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"魏絳","kind":"person","person_id":"nxl_qt6_cpl_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0030","start":30,"end":33,"surface":"趙襄子","kind":"person","person_id":"p4b_qf7_603_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"智伯","kind":"person","person_id":"fks_8ov_okp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAAAAAAAAABAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0136","start":136,"end":139,"surface":"秦昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"ao3_0fy_d45","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0141","start":141,"end":145,"surface":"義渠戎王","kind":"person","person_id":"g9z_9e2_jex","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0146","start":146,"end":149,"surface":"宣太后","kind":"person","person_id":"pvp_ebv_zcb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"二子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved"},{"id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m004-0155","start":155,"end":158,"surface":"宣太后","kind":"person","person_id":"pvp_ebv_zcb","status":"contextual_pro